    activity: { title: "Design Your Own Experiment", instructions: "Pick a testable question: do heavier objects fall faster? Does warm water dissolve sugar faster than cold? Does the color of light affect plant growth? Follow all five steps: (1) write your question, (2) write your hypothesis with reasoning, (3) plan your experiment — what will you change and what will you keep the same?, (4) run the experiment and record observations, (5) write your conclusion — did the data support your hypothesis? Present your experiment to your family like a real scientist." },
