    familyAdventure: "Do a Static Electricity Show. Rub a balloon on your hair and watch it stick to a wall (electrons transferred from hair to balloon). Rub your feet on carpet and touch a doorknob (electrons jump as a spark). Hold a charged balloon near small pieces of paper and watch them jump to the balloon. Then build a simple circuit together if you have a battery and small bulb — seeing a light turn on from a circuit you built is one of the most magical science experiences. Electricity is invisible — but its effects are everywhere.",
