      { question: "What energy transformation happens in a lamp?", answer: "Electrical energy transforms into light energy and thermal energy (heat)", options: ["Light energy transforms into electrical energy", "Electrical energy transforms into light energy and thermal energy (heat)", "No transformation occurs", "Chemical energy transforms into sound energy"] }
